Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.17,1:44:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好热啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.67,1:44:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.87,1:44:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,流汗了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.88,1:44:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,流汗我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.31,1:44:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢吗要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.78,1:44:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,舔一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.75,1:44:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,－是不是很咸 －是的
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.75,1:44:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.59,1:44:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你是被虐狂啊
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.29,1:44:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.93,1:44:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,让我用小穴帮你吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.44,1:44:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.24,1:44:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,想要了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.95,1:44:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.02,1:45:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好熟 为什么不流汗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.63,1:45:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是因为只吃薯条
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.66,1:45:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 原本就是吗\N不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.23,1:45:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,原本就是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.30,1:45:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,－是吗－是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.44,1:45:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,－好舒服啊－舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.71,1:45:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.45,1:45:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,要坏掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.26,1:45:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉前也要回想\N不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.15,1:45:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啊
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.04,1:45:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你女朋友会这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.51,1:45:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,－不会－不会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.58,1:46:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,动起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.69,1:46:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.16,1:46:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了吗 累了\N我要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.76,1:46:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,什么表情  很遗憾吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.74,1:46:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在很遗憾吗
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.78,1:46:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.61,1:46:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.79,1:46:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要一直做到你动不了为止
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.63,1:46:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.83,1:46:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 受不了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.97,1:46:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.23,1:47:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗 要射了吗\N好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.73,1:47:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,射了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.77,1:47:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.81,1:47:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,－射了－不行
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.48,1:47:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.35,1:47:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,想要射吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.56,1:47:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,－不行－想要射了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.89,1:47:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都这个表情了
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.40,1:47:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.40,1:48:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好熟练
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.93,1:48:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.30,1:48:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,－还没射吧－还没
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.21,1:48:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,想要射了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.62,1:48:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那么  只要说比她舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.99,1:48:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,－不可以说－就可以了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.79,1:49:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我会保密的
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.10,1:49:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,和蕾娜吗
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.07,1:49:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,比她做爱  还要舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.64,1:49:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,做的不错
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.42,1:49:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那么快过来
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.20,1:49:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.68,1:49:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,都插进小穴了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.59,1:50:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,想要射了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.96,1:50:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.86,1:50:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以哦
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.67,1:50:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一副真的的表情
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.24,1:50:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,－一直想要吗 －是的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.45,1:50:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,射的时候要说哦
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.72,1:50:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,－好的－想射哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.96,1:50:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.73,1:50:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要射嘴里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.35,1:51:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看我 快看我
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.96,1:51:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,喊我名字－千春
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.33,1:51:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,喊着我的名字射吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.50,1:51:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,千春 好舒服\N舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.50,1:51:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.54,1:51:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.54,1:51:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.68,1:51:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,射的时候要说哦
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.18,1:51:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不要呀
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.12,1:51:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,－不行了－要射了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.86,1:51:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,必须要说哦
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.20,1:51:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,射了哦 射了\N不行了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.98,1:52:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,射到哪里了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.22,1:52:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,－好远啊－全都是了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.96,1:52:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.66,1:52:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,－对不起－让我帮你清理
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.83,1:52:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,清理吗
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.72,1:52:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.92,1:52:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,社科好的 你看\N对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.46,1:52:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你看好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.17,1:53:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,湿漉漉的
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.64,1:53:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,射了好多
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.44,1:53:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了\N第二次也好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.84,1:53:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,非常舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.25,1:53:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱 谢谢\N谢谢什么 好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.79,1:53:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢我让你射吗
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.90,1:53:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,－很舒服－舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.00,1:53:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,比蕾娜舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.37,1:53:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那么继续约会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.01,1:53:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,继续约会
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.41,1:53:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.65,1:53:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真的太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.96,1:53:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,－是的－都湿了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.46,1:54:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还是再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.33,1:54:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,继续吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.07,1:54:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在吗 刚结束\N额额
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.31,1:54:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,可是还没洗澡
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.37,1:54:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,－去洗澡吗－走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.11,1:54:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,－小心点－走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.78,1:54:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一起吧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.79,1:54:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,（瞒着女朋友约会）\N（勃起了就要去酒店）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.22,1:54:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,（某商场）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.56,1:54:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,－突然好成熟－喜欢这个吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.06,1:54:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,比起刚才的
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.46,1:54:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,都喜欢－是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.17,1:54:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,奶子挡起来如何
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.70,1:54:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,－但是有形状－是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.97,1:54:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的氛围不一样
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.31,1:54:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,尝试了一下
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.01,1:54:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,－什么颜色－黄色
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.42,1:54:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个眼神适合你
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.12,1:54:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.06,1:55:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,－快点来吧－系上安全带
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.63,1:55:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,－非常感谢－都停了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.93,1:55:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-3秒后开始-我不是很会
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.38,1:55:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,差点撞到了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.15,1:55:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,－好害羞－慢点
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.42,1:55:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我认真的－等等
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.76,1:55:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.26,1:55:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,－不行受不了－等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.43,1:55:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了 怎么办\N慢一点
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.40,1:55:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,－不行 －一直撞
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.00,1:55:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,－慢一点－好害羞
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.07,1:55:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不行 不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.04,1:55:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,－等一下\N－这个好难啊
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.81,1:55:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.82,1:56:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.99,1:56:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N下次就挑战吧拜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.49,1:56:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.09,1:56:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,自己会动呢
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.79,1:56:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.83,1:56:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.10,1:56:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好有趣\N是的看看多少
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.40,1:56:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,75分\N60分就合格了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.57,1:56:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,－练习了好多次吧 －是的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.41,1:56:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.38,1:56:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,神啊 有这样的人吗\N是的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.78,1:56:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,－一直撞吧－是的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.69,1:56:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是一直在中间
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.22,1:56:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗  可是真的很难
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.06,1:56:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.27,1:57:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,会被看到的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.64,1:57:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧  心跳很快吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.78,1:57:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很少这样
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.18,1:57:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不说不行了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.35,1:57:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.75,1:57:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,因为已经做了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.09,1:57:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.46,1:57:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,还想要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.06,1:57:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这个不要问啊
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.60,1:57:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,非常喜欢吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.44,1:57:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法  都是这样的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.94,1:57:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 才不是所有男人\N你才是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.41,1:57:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,－是吗 －是的
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.16,1:57:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得规则吧
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.79,1:57:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,－规则－勃起后去酒店
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.17,1:58:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,还要去吗\N当然了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.47,1:58:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,－你以为结束了吗－是的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.67,1:58:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那还想要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.08,1:58:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.68,1:58:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,约会呢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.52,1:58:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,再逛一会吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.86,1:58:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,－走吧－嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.66,1:58:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.86,1:58:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,约会
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.24,1:58:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好多人 不得了\N是的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.14,1:58:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,－好害羞 －是的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.48,1:58:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢被一只看着
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.59,1:58:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,日本人就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.62,1:58:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,躲起来太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.96,1:58:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,裤子都硬梆梆的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.69,1:59:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,－是的呢 －你看
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.20,1:59:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,都湿了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.54,1:59:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.04,1:59:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 快摸我
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.98,1:59:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以的 快点挡起来\N等等
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.12,1:59:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,完蛋完蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.49,1:59:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么  不行的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.13,1:59:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,－害羞吗 －害羞
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.76,1:59:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,－喜欢吗 －不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.33,1:59:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,－不是的 －喜欢这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.74,1:59:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.44,1:59:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 会被发现的\N等等
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.18,1:59:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.11,1:59:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是和高中生一样\N这样奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.02,1:59:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,－才不会这样呢 －是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.35,2:00:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,－真的吗 －太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.06,2:00:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,太认真了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.29,2:00:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 太夸张了\N是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.23,2:00:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,太夸张了  这里吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.93,2:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.17,2:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不行
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.37,2:00:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我和她谁好
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.74,2:00:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,各个方面的话
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.85,2:00:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我要想想
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.32,2:00:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是我吗
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.83,2:00:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,亲一下
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.07,2:00:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,－还要亲吗－很多人看薯
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.08,2:00:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都这样
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.85,2:01:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,－可是很害羞－害羞
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.11,2:01:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,－真的很害羞－害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.75,2:01:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.69,2:01:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真的不太擅是
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.89,2:01:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  肯定的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.16,2:01:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,笑一个
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.06,2:01:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,－是影片哦－影片啊
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.96,2:01:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,－怎么是影片 －怎么了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.43,2:01:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,－是影片 －影片啊
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.54,2:01:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,－后面很漂亮－是的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.21,2:01:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,－是不是故意的 －不是的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.54,2:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,－是吧－是的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.72,2:01:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你也可以主动哦
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.55,2:01:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,故意的
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.36,2:01:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,－太过了－留下回忆
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.16,2:01:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会发出去吗
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.47,2:01:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.07,2:01:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行哦
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.27,2:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现了会分开吗
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.54,2:02:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候再看
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.91,2:02:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,－现在不行 －不行吗
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.65,2:02:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,颜色变了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.25,2:02:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,－是的你看 －是的
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.96,2:02:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要不和我交往
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.60,2:02:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,太突然了吧太突然了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.41,2:02:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但是那个
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.51,2:02:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得不错吧
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.14,2:02:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这个
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.41,2:02:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,－这个－这个怎么了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.92,2:02:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,－我也觉得 －是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.45,2:02:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.42,2:02:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,－开心吗－开心
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.12,2:02:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法顺其自然
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.10,2:02:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜到了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.96,2:02:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.23,2:03:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就是想这样
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.10,2:03:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.81,2:03:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,－好开心－为了这个吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.78,2:03:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的所以才约会
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.01,2:03:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,－约会的感觉 －是的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.62,2:03:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,去摩天轮吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.42,2:03:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 走吧\N额额
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.76,2:03:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好美
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.56,2:03:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,－不怕吗－你怕吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.06,2:03:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,－我没事 －是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.77,2:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没事你怕吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.50,2:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,－不怕－在发抖啊
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.77,2:03:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,才没有呢
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.87,2:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不是 很色吧
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.41,2:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,－这个－这是什么
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.62,2:03:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没穿吗
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.22,2:03:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你猜
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.05,2:03:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.66,2:03:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,摸摸看
Dialogue: 0,2:03:57.39,2:04:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要摸吗  穿了啊
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.60,2:04:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,－吓我一跳－是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.63,2:04:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,－喜欢不穿吗－不是的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.57,2:04:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.61,2:04:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现会挨骂
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.95,2:04:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,会挨骂 －是的
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.65,2:04:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.75,2:04:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如何－很热
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.85,2:04:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很热吗摸摸看
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.86,2:04:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,伸进去吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.09,2:04:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不可以的\N是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.13,2:04:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,快点拉上－心跳加速了吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.74,2:04:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.38,2:04:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.25,2:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是真的喜欢
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.49,2:05:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.76,2:05:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,骗你的
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.10,2:05:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳\N你以为我骗你吗
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.14,2:05:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的吗－不喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.47,2:06:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以这样了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.14,2:06:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.34,2:06:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好高－马上最高了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.31,2:06:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,－这个－好美啊
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.81,2:06:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.22,2:06:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好大－真的变的好大
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.02,2:06:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不得了
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.06,2:06:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.10,2:06:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好怕－害怕吗
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.93,2:06:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抱抱
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.87,2:06:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的没关系
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.14,2:07:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吗
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.95,2:07:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,最高点要亲亲
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.35,2:07:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗－是的
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.76,2:07:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,马上到了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.69,2:07:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,321
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.13,2:07:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,已经过去了
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.80,2:07:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是的呢\N过去了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.01,2:08:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,和你一起坐好开心
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.64,2:08:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是－真的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.36,2:08:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,和女朋友分开吧
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.07,2:08:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,女朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.73,2:08:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,和蕾娜吗
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.85,2:08:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说现在
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.15,2:08:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.19,2:08:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.85,2:08:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,2:08:57.39,2:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.76,2:09:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是又想骗我
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.58,2:09:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了  真的分不清
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.45,2:09:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会玩弄感情的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.02,2:09:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的吗－是的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.46,2:09:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是告诉你我的心情\N分开
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.17,2:09:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,分手需要一点时间
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.11,2:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,分不分开无所谓的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.94,2:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.68,2:09:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只要互相舒服就可以了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.72,2:09:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才  非常的
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.79,2:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,硬的很大
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.72,2:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N现在也是
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.66,2:10:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你在摸我
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.86,2:10:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以去酒店吧
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.37,2:10:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好美\N是的
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.85,2:10:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N喜欢
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.85,2:10:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.42,2:10:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等  等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.63,2:10:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,只是想告诉你
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.00,2:10:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.77,2:10:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,－背后好可爱－是吗
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.58,2:10:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样吗\N好美没错
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.45,2:11:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,特意打扮的\N很适合你
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.72,2:11:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.89,2:11:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,在做什么\N抓住
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.62,2:11:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,抓不住
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.17,2:11:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在跑呢
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.54,2:11:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不害羞了\N真的吗  不害羞了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:11:34.62,2:11:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 习惯了\N习惯了
Dialogue: 0,2:11:38.49,2:11:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.12,2:11:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不行－还不习惯吗
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.86,2:11:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞\N害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.33,2:11:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,－不可以这样吗－不行
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.44,2:14:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.39,2:14:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,－忍不住了吗－因为
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.34,2:14:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.05,2:14:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.35,2:14:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,－好色－真是的
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.25,2:14:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞\N害羞吗
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.19,2:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住了\N忍不住了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.74,2:15:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让我兴奋起来吧
Dialogue: 0,2:15:53.81,2:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,继续吗\N继续
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.07,2:16:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,湿了
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.49,2:16:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好香
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.67,2:16:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:17:03.08,2:17:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.45,2:17:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我要高潮了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.12,2:17:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.86,2:17:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.94,2:17:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,－不行吗－湿渡漉的
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.04,2:17:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不喜欢舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.44,2:17:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.11,2:17:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.82,2:17:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.84,2:18:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.23,2:18:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,－可以继续摸吗－嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.39,2:18:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.29,2:19:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.76,2:19:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不行不可以啊
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.90,2:19:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.94,2:19:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.55,2:19:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好下流
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.42,2:19:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃\N好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.89,2:19:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,继续吃吧
Dialogue: 0,2:19:41.90,2:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不行高潮了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:47.64,2:19:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了  我高潮了
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.18,2:19:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,要高潮了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.32,2:20:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多到我了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.79,2:20:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 快点过来吧\N等一下啊
Dialogue: 0,2:20:20.01,2:20:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这么主动真过分
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.71,2:20:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.28,2:20:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,让我叶你
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.85,2:20:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.49,2:20:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.41,2:20:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.03,2:21:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.76,2:21:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服\N舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.17,2:21:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.57,2:21:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,因为在摸乳头
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.71,2:21:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.35,2:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你舒服的地方我都知道
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.69,2:21:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:21:59.81,2:22:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等等不行
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.05,2:22:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒\N不行了吗
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.86,2:22:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.55,2:22:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是这里吧
Dialogue: 0,2:22:41.08,2:22:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,2:22:49.72,2:22:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.56,2:22:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:54.73,2:22:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,2:22:58.23,2:23:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞一点吧等等
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.14,2:23:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不行
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.57,2:23:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,－不行了吗－好舒服啊
Dialogue: 0,2:23:23.56,2:23:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,2:23:34.60,2:23:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以\N一直发抖呢
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.51,2:23:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗\N太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,2:23:49.15,2:23:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,2:23:54.62,2:23:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我要射了\N不行
Dialogue: 0,2:23:57.12,2:23:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以的
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.87,2:24:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不行
