Dialogue: 0,2:59:48.01,2:59:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 好了\N好了
Dialogue: 0,2:59:53.08,2:59:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,－完美了－是的
Dialogue: 0,2:59:58.65,2:59:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢你
